> Hi Charlie,
>
> I hope your move and job hunting has been a success. Do you have any firmer idea of when you might have time for another release of tikzDevice?

Hi Alastair,

Unfortunately, I don't have a firm idea of when a release will happen. Getting version 0.7 released is still one of the top items on my todo list, but other things keep getting in the way. It will happen as soon as I can get a block of free time big enough to go through the QA checklist on Windows, Linux, OS X and Solaris.

That being said, the development builds of the package are still available from R-Forge:

    install.packages('filehash')
    install.packages('tikzDevice', repos = 'http://r-forge.r-project.org')

-Charlie

